{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1079879-can-i-still-throw-money-in-the-kickstarters","id":1079879,"title":"Can i still throw money in the kickstarters?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-17T11:04:08-07:00","id":1079879,"title":"Can i still throw money in the kickstarters?","content":"ok i never beenable to donate to a kickstarter. i have the money but im trying to figure this black sorcery known as paypal<br /> <br /> but i wanted to know if i can still throw in some bucks on Wraith/Changeling or is it too late for that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T11:11:50-07:00","id":1079883,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-changeling-the-dreaming-20th-anniversary-ed?ref=nav_search\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...ref=nav_search</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-wraith-the-oblivion-20th-anniversary-editio?ref=nav_search\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...ref=nav_search</a><br /> <br /> Looks like you can with Changeling but not with Wraith. Note also that Kickstarter does not accept PayPal but I believe BackerKit does, so I think you're still good on Changeling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-17T11:34:30-07:00","id":1079898,"title":"","content":"You can't really throw money into a Kickstarter after it ends. Project creators have been known to do things like count payments/donations through other sources towards Stretch Goals, but so far I don't think Rich has done that. Rich has moved to using BackerKit, which lets you buy stuff and as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar707_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"707\" data-vbnamecard=\"707\">etherial</a> noted takes more forms of payment. It doesn't count towards the Kickstarter itself, but it lets you purchase add-ons, and the like if you couldn't afford it before the campaign ended or messed up your donation; so it's still money going to buying the product. The BackerKit store is way more useful for the rewards like dice or ST screens that Onyx Path don't currently have a good way to get to customers outside of Kickstarter drives. Buying C20 via BackerKit vs. DriveThruRPG when it comes out there isn't going to make a big difference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-